      "description": "Checks quest state via $0101EC against threshold $FF17B7. Allocates entity slot via $DA2A and checks limit $0102BE. Reads entity type d1.w (stored to +$00), constructor $8D06, visual flag +$66, facing +$16, parameter +$96, positions via $103B0, sets HP +$88/+$8A, drop +$8C, runs animation $9D00, and starts AI from $DF54 for type >= $16.",
