      "end": "0x00FEDE",
      "size_bytes": 212,
      "description": "Dual-compound entity spawner (Types $72 and $70). Checks quest state vs threshold $FF17B7 - 1. Allocates primary slot a5 (Type $72) and secondary slot a6 (Type $70) via $DA2A. Configures visual flags +$66(a5) = 9, +$66(a6) = 5. Assigns shared HP d2 to both entities. Cross-links mutual pointers: +$A6(a5) = a6 and +$A6(a6) = a5. Sets composite positions via $1046C and clones coords (x, y) from a6 to a5. Activates coordinated compound AI routines: $01DF1C for a6 and $01D140 for a5.",
